{"game": "mass-effect-andromeda", "language": "english", "appid": 1238000, "month": "2022-08", "window": 3, "start_date": 1660608000, "end_date": 1661299199, "month_true_total": 98, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 21:57:10 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "121107672", "author": {"steamid": "76561198074352796", "personaname": "ramsuzenet", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ramsuzenet/", "num_games_owned": 477, "num_reviews": 35, "playtime_forever": 488, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 292, "last_played": 1661277913, "avatar": "814605c1904e56feba23784f27a7ccdf7f81fa94"}, "language": "english", "review": "Not much to be said about Andromeda that hasn't already been said; it is lacking in all departments, except the combat, which feels great to play. The world, the story, the characters etc. fall flat, and had it not been for the Milky Way species being in Andromeda, you'd struggle to find any resemblance to Mass Effect in this game -- hopefully, we will get a worthy successor next cycle", "timestamp_created": 1661255129, "timestamp_updated": 1661255129, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 21, "votes_funny": 4, "weighted_vote_score": "0.670591771602630615", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "121097077", "author": {"steamid": "76561198130627642", "personaname": "Krixius", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Krixius/", "num_games_owned": 315, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 9635, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6846, "last_played": 1785433671, "avatar": "737e6cb5e7f4f37b30bca1de1174b95eddeb6a91"}, "language": "english", "review": "What an Experience!\n\nThe combat is a big step up from previous titles, and it's a lot of fun! Great story, and amazing characters, like BioWare usually does. And I even enjoyed riding around in the Nomad, where as I hated the Mako in the 1st installment in the series. I didn't get bored for a second!! Mass Effect will always be my favorite series of games, and this game just added to my love for it! Can't wait for more future Mass Effect titles!\n\nOne of those that you wish you could forget, so that you can experience it again for the 1st time!", "timestamp_created": 1661234005, "timestamp_updated": 1661234005, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "121093266", "author": {"steamid": "76561198008599753", "personaname": "Bolen1", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198008599753/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 2539, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 957, "last_played": 1664757831, "avatar": "933860e5e7817b0fcb301f52c49fe266328fec3d"}, "language": "english", "review": "good game", "timestamp_created": 1661225952, "timestamp_updated": 1661225952, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "121070903", "author": {"steamid": "76561199007319638", "personaname": "Fagatron", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199007319638/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 830, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 283, "last_played": 1719677727, "avatar": "793a34951